Wiktoria Gazda

+48 5 3 5 2 7 7 7 9 9

--ENG--

I am pleased to present this spacious apartment for rent, with an area of 81 m² and a large terrace, located at 10 Przegon Street in Kraków.

 LOCATION

The property is located in Zwierzyniec, one of the most attractive and green areas of Kraków. One of its main advantages is the proximity to many green and recreational areas, such as Kraków Błonia, Decjusz Park, Kościuszko Mound, Kraków Zoo and the Bielany-Tyniec Landscape Park.

The location offers a peaceful neighbourhood with easy access to shops, services, schools and kindergartens, as well as convenient transport connections to other parts of the city.

LAYOUT

This three-room apartment is finished and furnished to a high standard. It is located on the first floor and consists of:

- living room with an open-plan kitchen;

- bedroom;

- additional room that can be arranged to suit your needs;

- bathroom;

- entrance hall;

- large terrace.

 ADDITIONAL INFORMATION

- underground parking space available for rent;

- the apartment is available immediately.

RENTAL COSTS

- Monthly rent: PLN 5,800;

- Administrative fees: PLN 1,000;

- Electricity: paid according to actual usage;

- Underground parking space: PLN 500 per month (optional);

- Security deposit: equal to one month's rent;

- Agency fee applies.

 CONTACT

Wiktoria Gazda

+48 5 3 5 2 7 7 7 9 9

